  "changed_since_previous": "Enforces `!txin.scriptSig.IsPushOnly()` on nested P2SH inputs prior to evaluation.",
  "card": "Fixes input public key extraction validation in BIP-352 silent payments (GetPubKeyFromInput). Previously, redeem script hashes and witness program hashes were not checked against the UTXO scriptPubKey, allowing non-P2WPKH P2SH inputs (such as multisig) spent with a P2WPKH redeem script to be falsely included in the aggregate public key sum, corrupting shared secret derivation. This PR preserves the script hash before running Solver, verifies redeem script and witness pubkey preimage hashes, enforces push-only single-element scriptSigs for P2SH, and checks exact witness stack depths.",
